    "updated_at": "2023-03-30T17:39:41Z",
    "body": "For context, we have gotten some feedback that it feels faster when the same site does a secondary request from the client to the server to fetch more content with script - instead of embedding it into the stream. Objectively it's not \"faster\" to do the second roundtrip but the indicator stopping earlier makes it feel faster because the main UI is stable faster.",
